sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor B as Buyer (order page)
    participant API as API (WS /realtime/orders)
    participant L as LISTEN order_events (one per API process)
    participant W as Writer (worker / scheduler / API)
    participant DB as Postgres

    B->>API: open socket
    B->>API: {"type":"auth","token":"…"} (within 5 s)
    alt bad, revoked or expired token
        API-->>B: close 4401 (the client refreshes once, then backs off)
    else ok
        API->>API: registry.add(user, socket)
    end
    W->>DB: BEGIN, move the order (paid / buying / trade_sent / delivered / refunded / cancelled)
    W->>DB: pg_notify('order_events', '<user_id>:<number>')
    W->>DB: COMMIT
    DB-->>L: notification (delivered only on commit)
    L->>API: publish(user, number)
    API-->>B: {"type":"order.changed","number":"…"}
    B->>API: GET /orders/{number} (sees the committed state)
    Note over B,API: ping every 25 s, 60 s of silence → the client reconnects,<br/>polling keeps running as the reconciler
    API-->>B: close 4401 at the token's expiry
